direction: down

Cron: 每日 cron 触发 {class: base}
Export: "INSERT INTO FUNCTION s3\n按 dt + hash bucket 分区写入" {class: base}
Cnt: "源行数 == S3 行数?" {shape: diamond; class: base}
Sample: "抽样聚合\nCH vs chDB 一致?" {shape: diamond; class: base}
Alert: "告警 + 不回填\n分区保留在 CH" {class: hot}
Mark: "ALTER UPDATE\nexported_at = now" {class: warn}
Done: 分区进入可删除集合 {class: ok}
Watch: 人工介入 / CH 存储增长可见 {class: base}

Cron -> Export
Export -> Cnt
Cnt -> Alert: 不一致
Cnt -> Sample: 一致
Sample -> Alert: 不一致
Sample -> Mark: 一致
Mark -> Done
Alert -> Watch
